      "cooked": "<p>Greetings All!</p>\n<p>Was playing against Citizen Dawn earlier today, and “Channel the Eclipse” was played:</p>\n<p>“At the end of the Villain Turn, Citizen Dawn deals herself 2 cold damage; play the top card of the villain deck.”</p>\n<p>And she put into play Citizen Summer:<br>\n“At the end of the Villain turn, this card deals the two heroes with the most cards in play 3 fire damage.”</p>\n<p>Does Citizen Summer’s ability take effect if she comes in at the end of the turn, from an ability that took place at the end of the turn?</p>",
